      "raw_text": "To find the total number of days Andrew will travel, we need to calculate the time taken for each leg of the journey separately and then sum them up.\n\n**Step 1: Calculate the time taken to travel from New Jersey to Rochester by bus.**\nThe problem states that it takes 6 days to travel by bus.\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} = 6 \\text{ days} $$\n\n**Step 2: Calculate the time taken to travel from New Jersey to Rochester by car.**\nThe problem states that it takes \"half as many days\" to travel by car compared to the bus trip.\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} $$\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 = 3 \\text{ days} $$\n\n**Step 3: Calculate the total travel time.**\nAndrew's plan is to go to Rochester by bus and return from Rochester by car.\n- Leg 1 (New Jersey to Rochester): Bus trip = 6 days.\n- Leg 2 (Rochester to New Jersey): Car trip = 3 days.\n\n$$ \\text{Total Time} = \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} + \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} $$\n$$ \\text{Total Time} = 6 + 3 = 9 \\text{ days} $$\n\n#### 9<|im_end|>",
      "answer_text": "To find the total number of days Andrew will travel, we need to calculate the time taken for each leg of the journey separately and then sum them up.\n\n**Step 1: Calculate the time taken to travel from New Jersey to Rochester by bus.**\nThe problem states that it takes 6 days to travel by bus.\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} = 6 \\text{ days} $$\n\n**Step 2: Calculate the time taken to travel from New Jersey to Rochester by car.**\nThe problem states that it takes \"half as many days\" to travel by car compared to the bus trip.\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} $$\n$$ \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} = \\frac{1}{2} \\times 6 = 3 \\text{ days} $$\n\n**Step 3: Calculate the total travel time.**\nAndrew's plan is to go to Rochester by bus and return from Rochester by car.\n- Leg 1 (New Jersey to Rochester): Bus trip = 6 days.\n- Leg 2 (Rochester to New Jersey): Car trip = 3 days.\n\n$$ \\text{Total Time} = \\text{Time}_{\\text{bus}} + \\text{Time}_{\\text{car}} $$\n$$ \\text{Total Time} = 6 + 3 = 9 \\text{ days} $$\n\n#### 9",
